<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - GAP lowered on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GAP lowered on price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lazard Freres &amp; Co said analysts Todd Slater and Cynthia Mallin downgraded GAP Inc to hold from buy due to the stock's valuation.</p>
<p>-- The shares were off 1/4 to 38-1/8.</p>
</text>
